    "text": "If [ ] denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to the real number under consideration and $-1 \\leq x<0 ; 0 \\leq y<1 ; 1 \\leq z<2,$ then the value of the determinant\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/DgEyjvV-MrArf9uTrBueZOFNbrMce-IM0nBGrN4pi28.original.fullsize.png\"><br> is",
