  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since, $-1 \\leq x<0$ $\\begin{array}{ll}\\therefore \\quad & {[\\mathrm{x}]=-1} \\\\ & 0 \\leq \\mathrm{y}<1 \\quad \\therefore[\\mathrm{y}]=0 \\\\ & 1 \\leq \\mathrm{z}<2 \\quad \\therefore[\\mathrm{z}]=1 \\\\ \\therefore \\quad & \\text { Given determinant }=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 2\\end{array}\\right|=1=[\\mathrm{z}]\\end{array}$",
